      "content": "hey, i got these rough notes from a customer call we recorded for the new training manual. can u clean this up and make it sound professional for the official docs? here's the transcript:\n\n\"yo so i was lookin at my bill and it just dont make sense. i was told my rate was gonna stay low but now i see these extra charges popping up every month. i been a customer for a minute and nobody even called me to explain this. i need someone to fix this ASAP cause i'm not tryna pay for stuff i didnt sign up for.\"",
